{"t":"Corym","s":"corym-92642","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Pirats_Artwork_291989.jpg","q":3,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><figure class=\"thumb show-info-icon\" style=\"width: 180px\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> <img alt=\"Official Pirats artwork\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"219\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Pirats_Artwork_291989.jpg\" width=\"180\"/>  <figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> <svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg> <p class=\"caption\">Official Pirats artwork</p> </figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The <b>Corym</b> are a race of humanoid rats. They live in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin%20Corym%20Cave\">Carlin Corym Cave</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Venore%20Corym%20Cave\">Venore Corym Cave</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Tiquanda%20Corym%20Cave\">Tiquanda Corym Cave</a>. See also Glires.\n</p><p>The <b>Corym</b> race is unique in that it was named by the community.\n</p>\n<ul><li>CipSoft announced a contest on October 31, 2012, in which players could suggest the name for a new rat race (temporarily called <i>Rat men</i>) that were to be implemented with the December Update. Names could be submitted on the respective thread.</li>\n<li>The contest results were announced on November 9 and the winning name was <i><b>Corym</b></i>, suggested by Bunny Luv.</li></ul>\n<p><b>Pirats</b> are a special group of Coryms that have learned about <a href=\"#/wiki/Pirates\">Pirates</a> and decided to copy their way of living. <br/>\nPirats are generally weak to Earth. For AOE, take stone shower runes with you.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Corym\">Corym</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">Exp\n</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">HP\n</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">Loot\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default